        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;NOTES&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Conceptual star schema; not a physical table design.&lt;br&gt;• Grain: one row per Oman Remit remittance.&lt;br&gt;• dim_customer uses the canonical OCB customer key: ocb_customer_id.&lt;br&gt;• dim_geography represents remittance location, not customer location.&lt;br&gt;• dim_country represents the remittance origin country.&lt;br&gt;• remittance_type remains a fact attribute; it is not a separate dimension.&lt;br&gt;• Exact remittance timestamp remains on the fact for temporal analysis.&lt;br&gt;• No destination-country attribute is introduced because it is not currently an observed Silver/Gold attribute.&lt;br&gt;• Analytical measures and derived intelligence are excluded from this conceptual view.&lt;/font&gt;" mermaidId="n:NOTES" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="NOTES&#xa;&#xa;• Conceptual star schema; not a physical table design.&#xa;• Grain: one row per Oman Remit remittance.&#xa;• dim_customer uses the canonical OCB customer key: ocb_customer_id.&#xa;• dim_geography represents remittance location, not customer location.&#xa;• dim_country represents the remittance origin country.&#xa;• remittance_type remains a fact attribute; it is not a separate dimension.&#xa;• Exact remittance timestamp remains on the fact for temporal analysis.&#xa;• No destination-country attribute is introduced because it is not currently an observed Silver/Gold attribute.&#xa;• Analytical measures and derived intelligence are excluded from this conceptual view." id="t0tEXzvzONmXRnligy4o-10">
